# Every name here MUST also exist as a key in calorie_db.json (minus the
# "_comment"/"_local_dishes_comment" keys) or that class gets detected but
# shows no calorie value. To add local dishes (benachin, domoda, etc.),
# append them here with the next free index AND add matching entries to
# calorie_db.json — but you'll need your own labeled photos for those
# classes since no public dataset has them.
